  "key_observations_html": "<div style=\"border:1px solid #C7D8E8;border-radius:10px;padding:0.75rem 0.95rem;margin:0.1rem 0 0.55rem;background:#ffffff;box-shadow:0 1px 3px rgba(15,23,42,0.06);\"><ul style=\"margin:0.1rem 0 0 1.05rem;padding:0;color:#1F4C67;font-size:0.9rem;line-height:1.45;\"><li><strong>Stablecoin market cap fell 6.2% over 30D:</strong> Stablecoin market cap at $273.23B (6.2% lower over 30D). Related: <a href=\"https://www.theblock.co/news/business/2026-11-20-moonpay-applies-occ-national-bank-charter-444198\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">MoonPay applies for national trust bank charter to expand stablecoin services</a> (The Block).</li><li><strong>Stablecoin market structure remains concentration-led:</strong> leadership is still defined by a small set of large issuers/platforms; share shifts matter as much as aggregate market-cap growth. Related: <a href=\"https://cointelegraph.com/news/moonpay-seeks-us-bank-charter-for-stablecoin-custody-services?utm_source=rss_feed&amp;utm_medium=rss&amp;utm_campaign=rss_partner_inbound\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">MoonPay seeks US bank charter for stablecoin, custody services</a> (CoinTelegraph).</li><li><strong>Policy and reserves are resetting issuer priorities:</strong> Issuer and platform share can shift before aggregate market cap does, because policy and reserve quality determine which names institutions will hold. Related: <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMixAFBVV95cUxPYVRIYWtPUFZNUlZCdEw1eldKRVkyRXEtWFB6MzJIamxReEdfS3JfYkRhQ0hOdWhINTdfcW9BcXdMRzhpWkd2T2RLQ1o5QnpJc1g3dTQ1bVE2M2wxekxkQkx5MFNVWHRZOTBhcjh1ZktpS0tvejdhQWJFVlFlMVFjSm1URXhmVTQyUEpNOUx5bU1GNEVhbW1yT0tOcmw3cF9BSU94WFVSVkNWalp1c2tLUTN2dGItTUY3bnU4MHkyT1EydDEw?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Trump&#x27;s Democratic SEC pick suggests tokenization policy deserves full rule process</a> (CoinDesk).</li></ul><p class=\"takeaways__note\">Context only\u2014not investment advice. Bul